  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1102.54 Scheduled completion date",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1102.54 “Scheduled completion date” means the date stated in the original loan agreement or initial loan documents on which the project that received DWSRF funds is intended to be placed into use for the purposes for which it was intended.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Dw 1100) #13160, eff 1-20-21",
